// fires the admin cue; `while:` shows it only when that cue would do
// something. `by:` the four Antivirus who may be stationed there (the
// read-through picks who). A host part may press them too (a story rule
// hears any booth's press, Q2); no other booth may. (Wave 18, Q26: the
// door-only part is gone; the four share the door.) 🫘 is Adobe Acrobat's,
// at the printer (Adobe Acrobat's own hook: no other host is offered it).
INTERACTION radio_combo_a
