// ── The players' game (wave 21) ──────────────────────────
// Clippy and the four Antivirus play for ⭐ Points (TRAIT Player,
// cast/kit.loom). Their booths only learn their own buttons, and every one
// below is on a Mission objective (objectives.loom) as a pick, a scan or a
// global press.
// ✅ / 😤 / 🔢: one accept button each for the question being judged now
// (`Night.judge_now`), so a card's face (three buttons) holds ✅ 😤 🤷 for
// every question; 🔢 moves the question. A global (no guest): `program.*`
// reads false with no guest bound, so `program.uploaded != true` keeps a
// global off every guest card.
